      "writtenOn": "2020-04-08T01:30:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder if it is worth mentioning that Cr50 reboot and device reboot is not the same thing. \n\nCr50 never reboots unless the power (including battery) is disconnected or its firmware is updated. (or it crashes :P)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 14,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 14,
        "endChar": 19
      },
      "revId": "85e06f9ada262b4e2e99405235bff7f9eee497a4",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "52eb0d8f_a5a9469a",
        "filename": "docs/case_closed_debugging_cr50.md",
        "patchSetId": 13
      },
      "lineNbr": 14,
      "author": {
        "id": 1314845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-04-08T21:18:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes! I was going to ask about that because I wasn\u0027t sure when/if Cr50 reboots. What happens when the battery drains to zero? Does that count as a reboot?",
      "parentUuid": "94e8b6c0_86276387",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 14,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 14,
        "endChar": 19
      },
      "revId": "85e06f9ada262b4e2e99405235bff7f9eee497a4",
